  "rules": {
    "identity": "Exact filing form and literal line code. No case folding, suffix stripping or cross-form fallback.",
    "profile": "Re-use pinned v2 groups as physical occurrence evidence. Existing individual_decision and disposition remain unchanged; neither defines a new family total.",
    "memo": "Keep raw blank, null, X and other codes. A future nonmemo subtotal excludes X; unknown codes or unknown amounts remain unresolved. In-kind cannot be detected by absence of X.",
    "itemization": "Required itemization is a source reporting rule, not proof of complete, unique or effective processed membership. A thresholded detail subtotal is not the corresponding entire cover total.",
    "missing": "An absent line is not zero. Preserve explicit cover values and missing detail separately; do not name any cover-minus-detail residual unitemized money.",
    "money": "Keep exact signed cents, unknown amounts and duplicate physical occurrences. Never clamp negative values, add nested totals, or merge sender and receiver ledgers.",
    "time": "Map period columns only. Candidate election-cycle-to-date and PAC/party calendar-year-to-date are not period or two-calendar-year replacements.",
    "loans": "Schedule A records loan receipts; Schedule C/C1 adds terms, balances and guarantors, not another receipt amount. Candidate-guaranteed does not mean candidate-funded.",
    "transfers": "The category can include affiliated/authorized loans and repayments. It is not proof of a new donation, economic payment identity, or ultimate source.",
    "nonfederal": "H3 and H5 cover transfers into federal/allocation accounts. Keep nonfederal/Levin origin and account scope distinct; do not add their underlying receipts again.",
    "cash": "Receipt category, reported amount and spendable cash are separate. Contributions can include in-kind; refunds, repayments and offsets can return earlier money.",
    "summary": "Summary fields below are candidate counterparts by source definition. They do not establish compatible report/account/window membership or authorize numeric reconciliation."
  },
